From 49adf8d73a47167b0e0ee27ef7c057210db34bf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrey Stoyan <andrey.stoyan.csam@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:15:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/44] =?UTF-8?q?feat(chexc):=20capability=20lists=20in=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?types=20=E2=80=94=20elaboration,=20subtyping,=20overload,=20ove?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rride=20(M2)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- FuncTy::capTys: in interning identity (distinct types per author ruling),
  NOT in typeArgs — erased for CHIR/codegen by construction. Additive
  GetFunctionTy(…, capTys = {}); instantiation/substitution carry entries
  (generic throws E instantiates correctly).
- Elaboration in PreCheck for decls and functional types; entries must be
  subtypes of core Exception; THROWS_CLAUSE now validated (noneTyKinds).
- FFI ban: clauses rejected on foreign funcs, @C funcs, CFunc types.
- Subtyping §3.4: IsCapTysSubsumed (∀c2 ∃c1: c2 <: c1) in IsFuncSubtype /
  IsFuncTySubType; join = union with redundancy pruning, meet = entries
  covered by every operand (per proposal join/meet spec).
- §3.6: UnifyFuncTy never unifies capability lists.
- §3.7: signature comparison modulo caps via EraseCapTys in
  IsFuncParameterTypesIdentical (decl dup check, shadowing, candidates).
- §3.8: override throws-list pointwise subsumption in inheritance checker
  (generic-mapped, ctors exempt, note at overridden decl).
- §3.5 minimal: literals inherit expected type's capTys (checking is M3).

Gate: CheckedExceptions 21/21; ctest 49/49; Parser/Sema LLT 3934/3934;
clang-format clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
